    "title": "Dallas College will host 2 special food pantries to fill SNAP gap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CultureMap Staff ,\n9 hours ago In response to the U.S. government shutdown and accompanying loss of SNAP benefits, Dallas College will host two food pantries to distribute food on Saturday, November 8. The pantries are a partnership between Dallas College and the North Texas Food Bank. Drive-thru pantries are already held monthly at rotating Dallas... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 7",
